I used the **ai** variant because dida builds "tailor-made AI software for process automation", mostly NLP and computer vision, including semantic search for public administration and information extraction for Felmo, and all its development roles are ML roles. **Flags:** no computer-vision experience (a big part of dida's work); dida's team is research-heavy and some postings mention deep learning, but Hsan has no PyTorch or TensorFlow, so the CV doesn't claim it; the careers page lists no PFE or thesis internship (closest: Machine Learning Working Student) and no tech stack; no contact name in companies.csv, so the mail opens with "Hello,".
